OL,3,GNEWSAStation move could halve local
OL,4,Arail use, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FVillage residents have described plans
OL,7,Fto close a train station as
OL,8,F"disgraceful", saying it will leave
OL,9,Fthem feeling "isolated" and make life
OL,10,F"an absolute misery".
OL,12,FA new station is set to open in
OL,13,FWaterbeach in 2028 further north along
OL,14,Fthe track.
OL,16,FThe project is being funded by the
OL,17,FGreater Cambridge Partnership (GCP)
OL,18,Falongside Homes England to serve
OL,19,Fthousands of new homes.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
