OL,3,GNEWSAStation move could halve local
OL,4,Arail use, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Cambridgeshire District Council
OL,7,Fapproved up to 4,500 homes as part of
OL,8,Fthe Waterbeach New Town development in
OL,9,F2024 under the condition that no houses
OL,10,Fwould be built until a new station
OL,11,Fopens.
